# Powers the real live-visitor count at /api/presence. Without these set,
# it falls back to an in-memory count that only works for local `vercel dev`
# testing (resets on cold start, not consistent across instances).
#
# Easiest option: in the Vercel dashboard, go to Storage -> Marketplace ->
# add "Upstash for Redis". Vercel provisions it and injects KV_REST_API_URL /
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN into your project automatically -- no separate signup,
# nothing to paste here.
#
# Manual option: sign up at https://upstash.com yourself, create a Redis
# database, and copy these two values from its "REST API" section instead.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
